{"seq":33,"slug":"cloud-networking-vpc-design","title":"云网络与 VPC 设计","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design","rating":{"composite":3.92,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"云网络与-vpc-设计\">云网络与 VPC 设计</h1><p>云网络是所有云架构的骨架层——它决定了工作负载之间如何通信、流量如何被路由和检查、以及整个系统在多区域和混合场景下如何保持连通性与隔离性的平衡。本 hub 从网络工程师和平台工程师的视角出发，系统地覆盖 VPC 基础设施设计、跨账户与混合连接、DNS 与负载均衡、以及网络层安全运营四大领域。</p>\n<p>本 hub 与相邻 hub 的分工边界如下：网络层的零信任策略设计（身份验证网关、微隔离模型、策略引擎）属于 <code>zero-trust-architecture</code> hub 的范畴；合规审计与云安全态势管理（CSPM、SOC 2 映射）归入 <code>cloud-security-compliance</code>；CDN 边缘分发、边缘计算节点部署与缓存策略属于 <code>edge-computing-cdn</code>。本 hub 聚焦的是底层网络拓扑、路由控制、传输加密与网络可观测性——即&quot;线路&quot;本身而非线路上跑的应用层安全策略或内容分发逻辑。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：先从第一章 VPC 基础出发，理解子网划分、路由表与安全组的三层防护模型；再进入第二章学习跨 VPC 与混合云的连接模式；第三章掌握 DNS 解析与负载均衡的流量编排能力；最后通过第四章了解网络防火墙、流日志与自动化运维的实战落地。</p>\n<p>前置知识：读者应具备 TCP/IP 协议基础、CIDR 子网划分概念、以及至少一个主流云平台（AWS / Azure / GCP）的基本操作经验。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vpc-fundamentals","title":"VPC 基础设施","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/vpc-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vpc-subnet-design","title":"VPC 与子网设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/vpc-fundamentals/vpc-subnet-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"routing-tables-gateways","title":"路由表与网关","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/vpc-fundamentals/routing-tables-gateways"},{"seq":3,"slug":"security-groups-nacl","title":"安全组与网络 ACL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/vpc-fundamentals/security-groups-nacl"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"connectivity","title":"连接性设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/connectivity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vpc-peering-transit","title":"VPC 对等与 Transit Gateway","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/connectivity/vpc-peering-transit"},{"seq":2,"slug":"private-link-endpoints","title":"PrivateLink 与服务端点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/connectivity/private-link-endpoints"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hybrid-cloud-vpn-directconnect","title":"混合云 VPN 与专线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/connectivity/hybrid-cloud-vpn-directconnect"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"dns-loadbalancing","title":"DNS 与负载均衡","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/dns-loadbalancing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cloud-dns-architecture","title":"云 DNS 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/dns-loadbalancing/cloud-dns-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"load-balancer-patterns","title":"负载均衡器模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/dns-loadbalancing/load-balancer-patterns"},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-traffic-management","title":"全球流量管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/dns-loadbalancing/global-traffic-management"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"security-operations","title":"网络安全与运营","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/security-operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"network-firewall-waf","title":"网络防火墙与 WAF","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/security-operations/network-firewall-waf"},{"seq":2,"slug":"flow-logs-monitoring","title":"流日志与网络监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/security-operations/flow-logs-monitoring"},{"seq":3,"slug":"network-automation-iac","title":"网络自动化与 IaC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/security-operations/network-automation-iac"}]}]}